Adding an enricher for this is a quick fix:

```csharp
class ActivitySamplingFlagsEnricher : ILogEventEnricher
{
    public void Enrich(LogEvent logEvent, ILogEventPropertyFactory propertyFactory)
    {
        if (Activity.Current is {} current)
        {
            logEvent.AddOrUpdateProperty(propertyFactory.CreateProperty("IsAllDataRequested", current.IsAllDataRequested));
        }
    }
}
```

(Not checked/compiled/tested, so may need some tweaks :-))

Then `.Enrich.With<ActivitySamplingFlagsEnricher>()` should do the trick. HTH!

