Anyway, `Serilog` [has an API](https://github.com/serilog/serilog/pull/974) to capture the current `LogContext` as `ILogEventEnricher` and then you can restore it in the appropriate place.

```csharp
public void AfterReceiveReply(ref Message reply, object correlationState)
{
    var (log, context) = (ValueTuple<ILogger, ILogEventEnricher>)correlationState;
    log.ForContext(context) // restore captured context
        .Information("..");
}
public object BeforeSendRequest(ref Message request, IClientChannel channel)
{
    var correlationId = Guid.NewGuid();
    var log = Log.ForContext<T>().ForContext("WCFCorrelationId", correlationId);

    log.Information("...");

    var logContext = LogContext.Clone(); // capture current context
    return (log, logContext);
}
```

